  <!-- Gazebo colours.
       Every link is coloured through sdformat's URDF->SDF conversion, which turns each
       visual's <material><color> into SDF ambient/diffuse (Gazebo 9 / ROS Melodic and newer).
       No <gazebo reference> script materials (Gazebo/FlatBlack etc.) are used on purpose:
       they shade differently from converted colours, which made the chassis black and the
       arm black look different in Gazebo, and they cannot be applied per-visual on links
       that carry several colours (base_link, body5, left_link13, right_link23). -->
</robot>